d down to three king revealed  that the makeup crew applied sealant on  her as they didn't want her orange  makeup to stick to chairs removing the  makeup was an even lengthier process  that even led the makeup artists to  panic from rubbing alcohol to chemicals  to even having ing going into a sauna to  sweat the makeup off  one of the strangest yet most memorable  moments in the suicide squad was polka  dot man's polka dot rash david  dismulchen had always been a fan of  creature makeup growing up and had even  considered becoming a makeup artist  before ultimately becoming an actor so  he was eager to get on the makeup chair  while cgi was certainly on the table for  the character's rainbow cysts gunn opted  to go the practical route two different  makeup artists applied to smulchin's  makeup that is latex and wires and  lights i mean my face really would light  up and i looked like a walking christmas  tree version of the elephant man at  points  it's happening to his face again  the most noticeable thing about peter  capaldi's squad getup is the wires and  electronics protruding from his bald  head capaldi wasn't actually wearing a  bald cap for the film he actually did  shave his head for the heavy prosthetics  work gunn revealed that the prosthetics  work did take a little bit of reworking  to perfect it but was more than thrilled  with the  results hand over the drive while margot  robbie's harley quinn still looks very  similar to how she was depicted in birds  of prey and the first suicide squad  there was some changes done in the  makeup department fans weren't entirely  too crazy about some of harley quinn's  tattoos in her first live-action  appearance and evidently neither were  robbie and director james gunn who  particularly disliked a certain one that  made her feel simply just uncomfortable  and wasn't true to the spirit of the  character so the decision was eventually  made to remove the rotten tattoo from  quinn's face  pete davidson is mainly kn